  "response": "**The Unyielding Flame**\n\nBeneath the shifting stars and fleeting tide,\nWhere time erodes the stone and fades the name,\nOur bond remains, a quiet, sacred guide,\nA flame that burns without consuming flame.\n\nThe seasons turn from winter’s bitter frost\nTo summer’s heat, yet neither war nor peace\nCan break the vow that we have sworn and lost\nTo nothing but the truth of what we please.\n\nLet empires rise and crumble into dust,\nLet memories blur like smoke upon the wind,\nIn you, I find the truth I trust,\nA heart that beats for yours, to the end.\n\nSo let the ages pass in endless flight,\nMy love for you shall outlast the light.",
